prompt_templates.omni_prompt_template:
Begin exactly on the provided first frame ({frame_file}) and keep its faces, wardrobe, location, light and color grade for the entire 10 seconds.

{shot_block}

{timeline_block}

DIALOGUE (native audio, US English, lip-sync exact):
{dialogue_block}

AUDIO BED: {ambience}

CAMERA & MOVEMENT: {camera_block}

CONTINUITY: {continuity}

STYLE: {style}

RULES:
- One continuous 10-second take. Hard cuts only at the listed times; never cut to a different location.
- Speak only the dialogue above. No narrator, no added voices, no subtitles.
- No music, no score, no added sound design beyond the ambience and diegetic SFX listed.
- Keep faces stable and hands anatomically correct; no extra people.
- Native US English, conversational pace.

NEGATIVE: {negative}

DURATION: exactly 10.0 seconds. Aspect ratio 16:9.

prompt_templates.muse_prompt_template:
MUSE AI — SHORT-DRAMA SCENE {scene_id} — 10 SECONDS — 16:9
First frame (exact): {frame_file}. Keep the same faces, wardrobe, props, location, light and color grade for the entire shot.

{shot_block}

{timeline_block}

DIALOGUE (native US English, lip-sync exact, {speech_seconds}s of speech, finish by 8.0 s):
{dialogue_block}

AUDIO BED / SFX (diegetic only, no music): {ambience}

CAMERA & MOVEMENT: {camera_block}

CONTINUITY: {continuity}

STYLE: {style}

RULES:
- One continuous 10-second take with hard cuts only at the listed times; never change location.
- 2-4 internal cuts; every cut changes framing or blocking.
- Speak only the dialogue above; no narrator, no added voices, no subtitles.
- Native audio only: dialogue, breath, cloth, footsteps, weather, room tone. NO music, NO score.
- Keep faces stable, hands anatomically correct, no extra people, no identity drift.
- No on-screen text, captions, logos, watermarks or UI.

NEGATIVE: {negative}

OUTPUT: 16:9, exactly 10.0 seconds, native audio ON. Save as scene_{scene_id}.mp4.

prompt_templates.flow_prompt_template:
