Use the attached {frame_file} as the exact first frame / ingredient. Preserve faces, wardrobe, props, location, light and color grade.

{shot_block}

{timeline_block}

DIALOGUE (native US English, lip-sync exact, {speech_seconds}s of speech, finish by 7.5 s):
{dialogue_block}

AUDIO / SFX (diegetic only, no music): {ambience}

CAMERA: {camera_block}

CONTINUITY: {continuity}

STYLE: {style}

RULES:
- Generate the longest duration available (10 s if enabled; if the model caps at 8 s, generate 8 s and let post-production extend to 10 s).
- Hard cuts only at the listed times; no dissolves, no fades, no location change.
- Speak only the dialogue above; no narrator, no subtitles, no on-screen text, no logos.
- Native audio only. NO music, NO score, NO stock sound design.
- Stable faces and hands; no extra characters; no morphing.

NEGATIVE: {negative}

OUTPUT: 16:9, scene_{scene_id}.mp4, native audio ON.
